```text
ChunkMemo
    user-facing memoization wrapper

ChunkCache
    completion bitmap index + payload path planner

RunParameterSpace
    semantic parameter translation

RowMajorLayout
    positional flattening

CoordSelection
    symbolic tuple algebra

IndexSelection
    symbolic flat-index algebra

